# Local build state, never part of the website. The .ok markers record which photos
# STEP 1 has already compressed; the .attnew/.attold files are the scratch copies
# STEP 1 swaps a re-encoded photo through. All 245 markers used to be committed and
# served live at trailers/<folder>/.compressed_<photo>.ok - they were never content.
.compressed_*.ok
*.attnew
*.attold
